toolbox/cmocean/
================

cmocean.m - perceptually uniform oceanographic colormaps by Kristen Thyng,
Matlab function by Chad Greene (cmocean v1.3, 2016), copied unchanged from
Nicole's Dropbox/Matlab/startup_packages/cmocean_v1.3 so the ship computers
have it too. BSD license: license.txt (keep it with the file).
Used by visualization/MODvis_realtime_monitor.m.
